{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35817","headline":"题陈处士山居 · 李咸用","name":"题陈处士山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莲遶闲停柳遶池，蝉吟暮色一枝枝。\n未逢皇泽搜遗逸，赢得青山避乱离。\n花圃春风邀客醉，茅檐秋雨对僧碁。\n樵童牧竖劳相问，岩穴从来出帝师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}